    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting shooters back on the right track\u2014just as gamers want.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status Entropos is an original tactical first-person shooter featuring brutal battles in a fully destructible environment. Victory comes to the one who adapts, organizes and is unafraid to experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful weapons and dozens of gadgets for attack, defense or reconnaissance: create unique combinations yourself or with your teammates, turn your tactical creativity to the max!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of classic and modern weapons with detailed mechanisms and distinctive features, brutal character voiceover, customization, destructibility and dismemberment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique class system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809220/extras/c5d8625b684a254f8ac6c867039638cc.avif?t=1744395237\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety, fairness, and charisma. Five class-based characters, each with three distinct specializations. Each class is a unique character with their own backstory and motivations. Complete with original voices and dynamic relationships!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original visual style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809220/extras/921ddb82bd5cbcead49332497defbeef.avif?t=1744395237\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A down-to-earth war atmosphere:\u00a0original stylistics and a grim color palette immerse you in an alternate Modern History setting. Beneath the low-poly aesthetic lies meticulous attention to detail: authentic, carefully recreated weapons and gear, vehicles, and camouflage. And no pink skins here\u2014just gritty, worn-out uniforms!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809220/extras/deb7ab03337aba5d970ba0bdf18bd369.avif?t=1744395237\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status Entropos is a story about people in a complex world, unafraid to portray vastly different realities. You can expect an original brutal narrative, bold characters, and an equally daring approach to your freedom of choice: it\u2019s up to you to decide what\u2019s constructive and what\u2019s destructive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay tuned!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809220/extras/5548801c99924f06a75540c9dd3dfcf5.avif?t=1744395237\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game and the universe are in the process of development. New mechanics, new weapons, new characters and locations all over the world, new story discoveries are waiting ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular development updates are posted on Discord and other social media \u2014 join the discussions and stay connected!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add Status Entropos to Wishlist! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Status Entropos.</i><br><i>Made by gamers with love.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting shooters back on the right track\u2014just as gamers want.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status Entropos is an original tactical first-person shooter featuring brutal battles in a fully destructible environment. Victory comes to the one who adapts, organizes and is unafraid to experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful weapons and dozens of gadgets for attack, defense or reconnaissance: create unique combinations yourself or with your teammates, turn your tactical creativity to the max!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of classic and modern weapons with detailed mechanisms and distinctive features, brutal character voiceover, customization, destructibility and dismemberment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique class system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809220/extras/c5d8625b684a254f8ac6c867039638cc.avif?t=1744395237\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety, fairness, and charisma. Five class-based characters, each with three distinct specializations. Each class is a unique character with their own backstory and motivations. Complete with original voices and dynamic relationships!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original visual style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809220/extras/921ddb82bd5cbcead49332497defbeef.avif?t=1744395237\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A down-to-earth war atmosphere:\u00a0original stylistics and a grim color palette immerse you in an alternate Modern History setting. Beneath the low-poly aesthetic lies meticulous attention to detail: authentic, carefully recreated weapons and gear, vehicles, and camouflage. And no pink skins here\u2014just gritty, worn-out uniforms!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809220/extras/deb7ab03337aba5d970ba0bdf18bd369.avif?t=1744395237\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Status Entropos is a story about people in a complex world, unafraid to portray vastly different realities. You can expect an original brutal narrative, bold characters, and an equally daring approach to your freedom of choice: it\u2019s up to you to decide what\u2019s constructive and what\u2019s destructive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay tuned!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809220/extras/5548801c99924f06a75540c9dd3dfcf5.avif?t=1744395237\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game and the universe are in the process of development. New mechanics, new weapons, new characters and locations all over the world, new story discoveries are waiting ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular development updates are posted on Discord and other social media \u2014 join the discussions and stay connected!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add Status Entropos to Wishlist! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Status Entropos.</i><br><i>Made by gamers with love.</i></p>",
